            "speaker_id": 310108,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Same for me on the metal saw. I'll do the first run tomorrow morning and leave notes for the next shift.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 558848,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Perfect. So we're agreed. Decision: The pilot will start tomorrow with the day shift, followed by the evening and night shifts. All shifts will participate.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
